# Bifrost Provider Configuration Schema

Based on the documentation provided, here's the complete `config.json` schema with all available options:

## Full Schema Structure

```json
{
    "providers": {
        "{provider_name}": {
            "keys": [
                {
                    "name": "unique-key-name",
                    "value": "env.API_KEY_VAR or sk-...",
                    "models": ["model1", "model2"],
                    "weight": 1.0,
                    "azure_key_config": {
                        "endpoint": "env.AZURE_ENDPOINT",
                        "client_id": "env.AZURE_CLIENT_ID",
                        "client_secret": "[REDACTED:SECRET]",
                        "tenant_id": "env.AZURE_TENANT_ID",
                        "scopes": ["https://cognitiveservices.azure.com/.default"],
                        "deployments": {"model-name": "deployment-name"},
                        "api_version": "2024-08-01-preview"
                    },
                    "bedrock_key_config": {
                        "access_key": "[REDACTED:SECRET]",
                        "secret_key": "[REDACTED:SECRET]",
                        "session_token": "env.AWS_SESSION_TOKEN",
                        "region": "us-east-1",
                        "deployments": {"model": "profile-id"},
                        "arn": "arn:aws:bedrock:..."
                    },
                    "vertex_key_config": {
                        "project_id": "env.VERTEX_PROJECT_ID",
                        "region": "us-central1",
                        "auth_credentials": "env.VERTEX_CREDENTIALS",
                        "deployments": {"model": "deployment-id"}
                    }
                }
            ],
            "network_config": {
                "base_url": "http://localhost:8000/v1",
                "default_request_timeout_in_seconds": 60,
                "max_retries": 5,
                "retry_backoff_initial_ms": 1,
                "retry_backoff_max_ms": 10000,
                "extra_headers": {
                    "x-custom-header": "value"
                }
            },
            "concurrency_and_buffer_size": {
                "concurrency": 100,
                "buffer_size": 500
            },
            "proxy_config": {
                "type": "http or socks5",
                "url": "http://proxy-host:port",
                "username": "optional-user",
                "password": "optional-pass"
            },
            "custom_provider_config": {
                "base_provider_type": "openai",
                "allowed_requests": {
                    "chat_completion": true,
                    "chat_completion_stream": true
                }
            },
            "send_back_raw_response": false,
            "send_back_raw_request": false
        }
    }
}
```

## Key Configuration Options

| Field | Purpose | Example |
|-------|---------|---------|
| `network_config.base_url` | Override default API endpoint | `"http://vllm:8000/v1"` |
| `network_config.max_retries` | Exponential backoff retry count | `5` |
| `network_config.retry_backoff_initial_ms` | Starting delay between retries | `1` |
| `network_config.retry_backoff_max_ms` | Maximum retry delay cap | `10000` |
| `concurrency_and_buffer_size.concurrency` | Worker thread count | `100` |
| `concurrency_and_buffer_size.buffer_size` | Request queue size | `500` |
| `models` array | "Restrict key to specific models" | `["gpt-4o", "o1"]` |
| `weight` | Load balancing distribution | `0.7` |

## Common Use Cases

**Multi-key load balancing (70/30 split):**
```json
{
    "providers": {
        "openai": {
            "keys": [
                {"name": "key-1", "value": "env.KEY1", "weight": 0.7},
                {"name": "key-2", "value": "env.KEY2", "weight": 0.3}
            ]
        }
    }
}
```

**Self-hosted vLLM with custom timeouts:**
```json
{
    "providers": {
        "vllm-local": {
            "keys": [{"name": "vllm-1", "value": "dummy"}],
            "network_config": {
                "base_url": "http://vllm-endpoint:8000",
                "default_request_timeout_in_seconds": 120,
                "max_retries": 3
            },
            "custom_provider_config": {
                "base_provider_type": "openai"
            }
        }
    }
}
```

**Conservative Anthropic limits:**
```json
{
    "providers": {
        "anthropic": {
            "keys": [{"name": "anthr-1", "value": "env.ANTHROPIC_KEY"}],
            "concurrency_and_buffer_size": {
                "concurrency": 25,
                "buffer_size": 100
            }
        }
    }
}
```

Note: "Each key in a provider needs to have a unique name."

